# TEMPLATE ONLY. Nothing installs this automatically.
# The job itself decides "due" using Asia/Seoul (it exits with `not_due` before 11:00 KST),
# so this schedule must NOT be restricted to hours like 11-23: cron uses the host timezone and
# the production VM runs in UTC, where `11-23` would mean 20:00-08:00 KST and delay coaching
# until the evening. Run every ten minutes all day; the input hash avoids duplicate completed calls.
# Existing backup cron remains unchanged.
*/10 * * * * rocky cd /home/rocky/gk21/backend && /ABSOLUTE/PATH/TO/uv run python -m app.services.health_coaching_job
